   "summary": "These docket sheets provide a chronological index of incoming monthly political reports and despatches from the U.S. Embassy in Tokyo from August 1934 through June 1938. Each entry records the despatch number, date, drafting office, internal routing divisions, subject summary, and related decimal file cross-references. Pages 1 and 2 list reports 80 through 98 covering 1934-1936, while pages 3 and 4 provide identical copies of the docket for reports 113 through 126 covering 1937-1938.",
